#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:5
#: 3980227e056a4ef18662369bcfe22fcc
msgid "Building Mission Planner with Visual Studio"
msgstr "使用 Visual Studio 构建 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:8
#: 6fb93719fd81445aa83722d3cb80fbc1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:10
#: 87add199af6b428da433503e2a42fc53
msgid ""
"Mission Planner (MP) is an open source ground station developed in C# "
"primarily for use on Windows/linux computers (although it can be run on Mac "
"and Linux using mono). This is the most commonly used ground station as it "
"provides the most complete functionality for vehicle setup as well as pre-"
"flight mission planner, in-flight monitoring and post flight log file "
"analysis."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（MP）是一款用 C# 开发的开源地面站，主要供 Windows/Linux 电脑使用（也可通过 mono 在 Mac 和"
" Linux 上运行）。这是最常用的地面站，提供最完整的飞行器配置功能，以及飞前任务规划、飞行中监控和飞后日志文件分析功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:17
#: 92bd73119f784877963ae70606d4deba
msgid ""
"This page provides instructions on how you can build the Mission Planner "
"software on your own machine using MS Visual Studio which may be useful if "
"you wish to make changes for your own use or improvements for the community."
"  Building the mission planner may also help as a guide in case you plan to "
"build your own custom ground station development."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何在你自己的机器上使用 MS Visual Studio 构建 Mission Planner "
"软件，这对于希望为自己修改或为社区改进的开发者非常有用。构建 Mission Planner 也有助于指导你构建自定义地面站的开发工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:23
#: fd2d1c32d6e64270a2cb3d21dc0ab61e
msgid "Some warnings before you dive in:"
msgstr "在开始之前，请注意以下几点："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:25
#: d62ef4b1422b430cae0e2d3c62dad963
msgid ""
"Use your modified / complied version of Mission Planner at your own risk."
msgstr "使用你修改/编译的 Mission Planner 版本，风险自负。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:27
#: a48ec5aac4584d0a87c4670501ab7ccb
msgid ""
"Mission Planner is a very complex including and making changes is not for "
"the faint of heart. Here are the basic skills you will need to make "
"reasonable progress with MP changes:"
msgstr "Mission Planner 非常复杂，进行修改并非易事。以下是对 MP 进行合理修改所需的基本技能："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:31
#: 9d7534f4dc8d4f5b9e47de8eb72e54c1
msgid "C# programming skills and experience (at least or C++ experience)."
msgstr "C# 编程技能与经验（至少具有 C++ 经验）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:32
#: e2b8e1f3745b44c6bac4ae10584be36f
msgid ""
"Experience with Microsoft Visual Studio (VS) development environment. MP is "
"not the application to begin learning VS."
msgstr "Microsoft Visual Studio（VS）开发环境使用经验。MP 不适合作为学习 VS 的入门项目。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:34
#: 1c9386728fdb4c3e95c2e67cb696f158
msgid "Experience using Windows API  (Application programming Interface)"
msgstr "Windows API（应用程序编程接口）使用经验。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:35
#: fff5622c8b9b4863afb2da9ed53b9b50
msgid "Including understanding of streams, processes, threads."
msgstr "包括对流、进程、线程的理解。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:37
#: 5fe35d2824da4a4ab780112fce752134
msgid ""
"Support for Visual Studio, programming in C# and Windows API may not be "
"forthcoming from the DIY Drones community. You will need to get that support"
" from other sources."
msgstr ""
"DIY Drones 社区可能无法提供 Visual Studio、C# 编程和 Windows API 的技术支持，你需要从其他渠道获取帮助。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:42
#: 89e8cb892dd746beadb6ee9c39276812
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "系统要求"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:44
#: ecb039859a5547909108768a14db8670
msgid "Here is what you will need."
msgstr "所需条件如下。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:46
#: 3835bd4b3ef5419580b90eea2e59fde4
msgid "Windows 10 or later (Windows 7 and older versions are not compatible)."
msgstr "Windows 10 或更高版本（Windows 7 及旧版本不兼容）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:47
#: c6943c34afb34fff9c716d8848c21e54
msgid ""
"Sufficient disk space (around 20GB for VS installation), memory, processor "
"power to comfortably run Visual Studio."
msgstr "足够的磁盘空间（VS 安装约需 20GB）、内存和处理器性能，以便流畅运行 Visual Studio。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:49
#: 3f897e2ab40845e7b726779cf76949e0
msgid "An Internet connection."
msgstr "网络连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:50
#: 7e713ac8a3524526b5062afdd01c328c
msgid ""
"Visual Studio (**NOT VSCode**), at least version 2022. The Community Edition"
" suffices."
msgstr "Visual Studio（**不是 VSCode**），至少 2022 版本。社区版即可满足需求。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:53
#: 2bd95795f209496caac51032c870ba9a
msgid "Install Visual Studio"
msgstr "安装 Visual Studio"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:55
#: 32868f061902466f8d2287a76fb767d5
msgid ""
"Begin by installing Microsoft Visual Studio and configuring it for your "
"Windows system. Follow these steps:"
msgstr "首先安装 Microsoft Visual Studio 并为你的 Windows 系统进行配置。步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:57
#: 2489673114ff48469ece7f626f410930
msgid ""
"Download Visual Studio: Visit the `Microsoft Visual Studio download page "
"<https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/>`__ and download the "
"Community Edition by default."
msgstr ""
"下载 Visual Studio：访问 `Microsoft Visual Studio 下载页面 "
"<https://visualstudio.microsoft.com/downloads/>`__，默认下载社区版。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:59
#: 37464ae45c3d4e56a52acdcb4b49352d
msgid ""
"Customize Installation: Visual Studio is a comprehensive suite with built-in"
" Git support, but it can be overwhelming due to its complexity. To "
"streamline the installation process, consider these steps: - Access \"More\""
" in the Visual Studio installer. - Choose \"Import configuration.\" - Import"
" the provided configuration file: `vs2022.vsconfig "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/master/vs2022.vsconfig>`__."
msgstr ""
"自定义安装：Visual Studio 是一个内置了 git 支持的综合套件，但其复杂性可能令人不知所措。为精简安装流程，建议：- 在 Visual "
"Studio 安装程序中选择「更多」。- 选择「导入配置」。- 导入提供的配置文件：`vs2022.vsconfig "
"<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner/master/vs2022.vsconfig>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:64
#: 96d12530b0d14938a11aa3b779c4fcb8
msgid ""
"By following these instructions, you will have the necessary components "
"installed and ready for Mission Planner development."
msgstr "按照这些说明操作后，将安装好所有必要组件，为 Mission Planner 开发做好准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:67
#: fd52d6c00b31487d8d8e3dfc9305aa14
msgid "VSCode"
msgstr "VSCode"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:69
#: b3cd26c0d31a4757bcee29d128d934eb
msgid ""
"While Visual Studio Code with the C# plugin can parse the code, please note "
"that it **cannot build** Mission Planner at this time."
msgstr "带有 C# 插件的 Visual Studio Code 可以解析代码，但请注意它目前 **无法构建** Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:73
#: 2c7ed13ff591457ab0a676b2fe2dfd1b
msgid "After your VS installation is complete:"
msgstr "VS 安装完成后："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:75
#: e64734ac57034710b1569451a6990a51
msgid ""
"You should be able to use Git from the IDE. Clone `Mission Planner source "
"code <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner.git>`__ to get the full "
"code."
msgstr ""
"你应该可以在 IDE 中使用 git。克隆 `Mission Planner 源码 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner.git>`__ 以获取完整代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:78
#: 491d1f6c7d5944ea986ed20070e3fd40
msgid "Building the MissionPlanner"
msgstr "构建 MissionPlanner"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:80
#: 0ae2b86a15f84ce0a1a403fb31c66d15
msgid "To build the code, follow these steps:"
msgstr "按以下步骤构建代码："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:82
#: bae135988f264af1b49baf413cfa09f2
msgid "Open `MissionPlanner.sln` file with Visual Studio"
msgstr "用 Visual Studio 打开 `MissionPlanner.sln` 文件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:83
#: 84968916baaa4a789dc46919592a5649
msgid "From the \"Build\" menu, select \"Build MissionPlanner\""
msgstr "从「生成」菜单选择「生成 MissionPlanner」"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:86
#: c3ac989f4d7d4adaa6008aa601a6d1f6
msgid ""
"By default, Visual Studio will compile all projects and their dependencies "
"as part of a build process."
msgstr "默认情况下，Visual Studio 将在构建过程中编译所有项目及其依赖项。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:89
#: bd11f70e777a493a8cfb23b90a22b8df
msgid "Non Windows building"
msgstr "非 Windows 系统构建"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:91
#: ea8c7c58497b4a0599f8bab45b7aa54a
msgid "Building Mission Planner on other systems isn't support currently."
msgstr "目前不支持在其他系统上构建 Mission Planner。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:95
#: 16ebdae8b40a4d9e8c3c5d79f24912b7
msgid "Building the SimpleExample"
msgstr "构建 SimpleExample"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:100
#: 535336869ae7405296fdde1685cb74ab
msgid ""
"The \"SimpleExample\" solution is available as a near minimal application to"
" demonstrate how a C# program can connect to a vehicle and cause it to arm "
"or disarm. This example has many fewer dependencies than the full Mission "
"Planner and is simpler to build and understand."
msgstr ""
"「SimpleExample」解决方案是一个近乎最小化的应用程序，用于演示 C# 程序如何连接到飞行器并使其解锁或加锁。该示例比完整的 Mission "
"Planner 依赖项少得多，更易于构建和理解。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:105
#: 01ec0195573f4360855f91e1c7f063e5
msgid ""
"Open the solution from Visual Studio by selecting File >> Open >> "
"Project/Solution, and in the MissionPlanner code directory select ExtLibs / "
"SimpleExample.sln ( close the MissionPlanner solution first if you have that"
" open )"
msgstr ""
"在 Visual Studio 中通过 File >> Open >> Project/Solution 打开解决方案，在 MissionPlanner"
" 代码目录中选择 ExtLibs / SimpleExample.sln（如果已打开 MissionPlanner 解决方案，请先关闭）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:109
#: 9c6986cb0ec24001b85584f102b26ba1
msgid ""
"Ensure the program can be build successfully by selecting Build >> Build "
"Solution."
msgstr "选择 Build >> Build Solution，确保程序可以成功构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:112
#: 2bbfa795adf149b3933fbb227c68be3f
msgid ""
"After first checking that you can connect to your flight controller and arm "
"it with the regular mission planner, disconnect the regular Mission Planner "
"and then press \"Start\" to run the application in debug mode. When the "
"\"Form1\" pops up, select the COM port, the baud rate (probably 115200) and "
"press Connect.  If it successfully connects, press Arm/Disarm to attempt to "
"arm the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"先确认可以用常规 Mission Planner 连接到飞控并解锁，断开常规 Mission "
"Planner，然后按「Start」在调试模式下运行应用程序。弹出「Form1」后，选择 COM 端口和波特率（可能是 "
"115200），然后点击「Connect」。连接成功后，点击 Arm/Disarm 尝试解锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:119
#: ecf19140e7174186b4e816311c4ee912
msgid ""
"there is no error checking in the application if it fails to connect it"
msgstr "如果连接失败，应用程序中没有错误检查提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:124
#: 8c28f38d0e164107b3a308e52a92e466
msgid ""
"Following instructions are deprecated and were only kept for example. There "
"are probably not working and need update."
msgstr "以下说明已过时，仅作示例保留。这些说明可能不再有效，需要更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:128
#: a30668ecef0447fe8de4fa7eed811a0b
msgid "Editing and Debugging Mission Planner (and Other Tips)"
msgstr "编辑和调试 Mission Planner（及其他技巧）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:130
#: 8e0ba7df6c2741c781a992e7a27782fd
msgid ""
"Editing and debugging details are beyond the scope of this Wiki. Debugging "
"may result in some warnings. You should learn what they mean and take the "
"necessary steps to resolve them if that is the case. Here is a simple "
"debugging example to get you started."
msgstr "编辑和调试的详细说明超出了本 Wiki 的范围。调试过程中可能出现一些警告，你需要了解其含义并采取必要措施。以下是一个入门的简单调试示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:135
#: 023f0ed1ff804ffebbddf494c04568b0
msgid ""
"Do not (yet) connect your AutoPilot Hardware ( CubeOrange, etc. ) to the "
"compiled version of MP.  You must  first copy some .xml files to the "
"bin/debug folder. See details below."
msgstr ""
"暂时不要将飞控硬件（CubeOrange 等）连接到编译版本的 MP。你必须先将一些 .xml 文件复制到 bin/debug 文件夹，详见下方说明。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:138
#: 95bb07867c0f4b0ba2ca23b1517af59e
msgid ""
"First be sure VS is configured for debug (versus release) Set this in the "
"top menu tools area or the configuration manager."
msgstr "首先确保 VS 配置为调试模式（而非发布模式）。可在顶部菜单工具区域或配置管理器中设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:140
#: 5712ff01812748c3b649efa61cc07fb8
msgid ""
"Select menu DEBUG, Start Debugging.   (Or, press F5).  Mission Planner "
"should run as you normally see it.  However, some important configuration "
"files are missing so connection to the AutoPilot Hardware ( eg CubeOrange, "
"etc ) is not recommended at this time."
msgstr ""
"选择菜单 DEBUG，开始调试（或按 F5）。Mission Planner 应该正常启动。但由于缺少一些重要配置文件，此时不建议连接飞控硬件（如 "
"CubeOrange 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:145
#: f949c13e32ed4d58b8b03a75f48cdfdb
msgid ""
"If after \"Start Debugging\" the program loading hangs in the splash screen "
"and you see this message:  \"Managed Debugging Assistant 'LoaderLock' has "
"detected a problem ...... \"'  and/or the debugger has paused at the line  "
"Application.Run(new MainV2()); in ArduPilotMega.Program then do this:"
msgstr ""
"如果「开始调试」后程序在启动画面卡住，并显示以下消息：「Managed Debugging Assistant 'LoaderLock' has "
"detected a problem ……」或调试器在 ArduPilotMega.Program 的 Application.Run(new "
"MainV2()); 行暂停，请执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:151
#: b6e2030ebd564abda1435c436a788101
msgid ""
"Select [Debug],  [Exceptions].   Expand the [Managed Debugging Assistants]."
"  Uncheck the 'Loader Lock' check box"
msgstr ""
"选择 [Debug]，[Exceptions]。展开 [Managed Debugging Assistants]，取消勾选「Loader "
"Lock」复选框。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:154
#: 94782bf1edd144ea9e022e5bd5ea9713
msgid "Close MP. (Or, select menu DEBUG, Stop Debugging in VS)."
msgstr "关闭 MP（或在 VS 中选择菜单 DEBUG，停止调试）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:155
#: b9ac8731dda4406298af5fd333da9a20
msgid "Next you can try setting a break point."
msgstr "接下来可以尝试设置断点。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:157
#: ea4e7877ce4e49de827d8a16ead2537a
msgid ""
"Expand the MissionPlanner project in the VS Solution Explorer so you see the"
" objects included."
msgstr "在 VS 解决方案资源管理器中展开 MissionPlanner 项目，查看包含的对象。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:159
#: 7697c45ef7fd4cfda9219d527de1e6ca
msgid ""
"Scroll down to MainV2.cs, right click that object and select View Code."
msgstr "向下滚动到 MainV2.cs，右键点击该对象并选择「查看代码」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:161
#: edd5cb3360794bcca322e653f2c69181
msgid ""
"In the code window for MainV2.cs, scroll down to the line \"public MainV2\" "
"then to one of the first code lines after that ( currently it is a "
"log.Info(\"...\"); line ) ."
msgstr ""
"在 MainV2.cs 的代码窗口中，向下滚动到「public MainV2」行，然后找到其后的第一行代码（目前是一行 log.Info(「……」); "
"语句）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:163
#: b7ef2f71547944a0b7c7cb5498798e09
msgid ""
"Click in front of that line (In the dark gray bar on the left) to set a "
"break point  (red circle)."
msgstr "在该行前方（左侧深灰色栏）点击，设置断点（红色圆圈）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:165
#: 710bbadba28f4eee980ce9341382f8fb
msgid "Start Debugging  (press F5)."
msgstr "开始调试（按 F5）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:166
#: 4fc84aae93f34e07a23bb72ded7bc86e
msgid ""
"You will see the normal MP start up windows up to the Splash window but then"
" it will stop running.  You have hit the break point. Visual Studio will "
"show the code and the break point will be highlighted. Note that you cannot "
"move the splash screen so you may need to relocate the VS window to see the "
"break point."
msgstr ""
"你将看到 MP 正常启动，直到启动画面出现后程序停止运行，说明已命中断点。Visual Studio "
"将显示代码并高亮断点。注意你无法移动启动画面，可能需要重新定位 VS 窗口才能看到断点。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:171
#: b3b302bad9154eb6a44eeb6c6e438566
msgid ""
"Move your mouse over different variables and objects in the code. You will "
"see the current values of many or the items."
msgstr "将鼠标移到代码中的不同变量和对象上，将看到许多项目的当前值。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:173
#: 992e82bd7ca84ca68278029de69034e9
msgid "Press F5 and Mission Planner will continue loading."
msgstr "按 F5，Mission Planner 将继续加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:175
#: efd0da40bda144b0bb045e61bb10b601
msgid "Further details on editing and debugging are left to the user."
msgstr "编辑和调试的更多细节留给用户自行探索。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:178
#: 44f1a60c03d94e9cae945f967d1c8995
msgid "Using your modified Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用你修改后的 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:180
#: 64020df16815441a933679b2db0c86be
msgid ""
"If you make changes to Mission Planner, you will probably want to make use "
"of your version.  Here we will give you some preliminary information to do "
"that. You can use your local compiled version but the compiled output files "
"are located in different places in VS and some additional steps are "
"required.  There are configuration files specific to your installation of "
"Mission Planner that are not included in the Git hub download that are only "
"provided in the Mission Planner installation package. You will need to copy "
"these to the correct area in the folder you are using for the Visual Studio "
"project. Here are the steps that will get you started."
msgstr ""
"如果你对 Mission Planner 进行了修改，可能希望使用自己的版本。以下提供一些入门信息。你可以使用本地编译版本，但编译输出文件在 VS "
"中的位置不同，还需要额外步骤。Mission Planner 安装包中提供了一些特定于你的安装的配置文件，这些文件不包含在 GitHub "
"下载中。你需要将这些文件复制到 Visual Studio 项目所在文件夹的正确位置。以下步骤可帮助你入门。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:191
#: 07b35b8420d546988cacaac6beafb27e
msgid ""
"**Use your modified complied version of Mission Planner at your own risk.**"
msgstr "**使用你修改/编译的 Mission Planner 版本，风险自负。**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:193
#: cae2af614594475f9c3c428115aeca03
msgid "These steps assume VS is in the debug configuration.  [editors]"
msgstr "以下步骤假设 VS 处于调试配置。[editors]"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:194
#: 9f79b3cb12d745ddb4dc02b5cb892e58
msgid "Details when in Release mode could be added [/editors]"
msgstr "发布模式的详细说明可在此处添加 [/editors]"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:195
#: c26ade5a403c466f911f30fcc0c60da1
msgid ""
"In order for your VS version of MP to function with ArduPilot connected, you"
" will need to copy several files from the folder where MP is installed "
"(C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\APM Planner  or C:\\\\Program Files\\\\APM "
"Planner) to the folder where your VS project compiled output is located."
msgstr ""
"为使你的 VS 版本 MP 能与已连接的 ArduPilot 正常工作，需要将多个文件从 MP 安装目录（C:\\\\Program Files "
"(x86)\\\\APM Planner 或 C:\\\\Program Files\\\\APM Planner）复制到你的 VS "
"项目编译输出所在的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:201
#: 8c5681e6622547b1aab9f3c00d6982ec
msgid "Todo"
msgstr "待办事项"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:203
#: ecf4b82627ea4440a09613fb9bd23bd7
msgid ""
"editors: This needs to be made more accurate which files are needed, why "
"etc."
msgstr "editors：需要更准确地说明哪些文件是必需的，以及原因等。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:205
#: 06f4c0aec09149b8ab282d0c137220d7
msgid ""
"**Copy (don't move) all xml files** (I.E. files with the extension .xml) "
"from the root folder of the MP installation (C:\\\\Program Files\\\\APM "
"Planner)  **to the bin/Debug folder** in the folder where your Visual Studio"
" Mission Planner solution is stored. (the Git hub clone folder). This will "
"setup your compiled version to match the current configuration of your "
"AutoPilot (copter versus plane, other options, etc)"
msgstr ""
"**复制（不要移动）所有 xml 文件** （即扩展名为 .xml 的文件），从 MP 安装根目录（C:\\\\Program Files\\\\APM"
" Planner） **复制到 bin/Debug 文件夹** （Visual Studio Mission Planner 解决方案所在文件夹，即 "
"GitHub 克隆文件夹）。这将使你的编译版本与当前飞控的配置（多旋翼与固定翼，其他选项等）保持一致。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:212
#: cbe2adb588d24a848beddeb7f5989a03
msgid ""
"I.E, if you solution is in folder MPGitClone, then copy the .xml files to "
"MPGitClone\\\\bin\\\\Debug.  Some will copy without notice, but some  will "
"ask you if you want to replace the existing file. Replacing all seems to "
"work but you should investigate further to be sure you can use MP for real "
"life situations before you do so."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果你的解决方案在 MPGitClone 文件夹中，则将 .xml 文件复制到 "
"MPGitClone\\\\bin\\\\Debug。部分文件可直接复制，但部分文件会询问是否要替换现有文件。替换所有文件似乎可以正常工作，但在实际场景中使用"
" MP 之前，你应该进一步确认。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:217
#: a73425c3994b48b1b3f0d8ade9f6d5f2
msgid ""
"If you build Mission Planner in Release mode, then the files should be "
"copied to the bin/Release folder. This has not been tested at this time."
msgstr "如果以发布模式构建 Mission Planner，则应将文件复制到 bin/Release 文件夹。此流程目前尚未经过测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:221
#: 0f4cd6e51cac4315a77750bde11cc40f
msgid "Here are some other tips:"
msgstr "其他一些技巧："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:223
#: 387e6748576742099baaba1c9d546d1b
msgid ""
"Location of Logs saved when using your version will be in the /bin/Debug or"
"  bin/Release folder. This can be changed with Mission Planner 1.2.63 and "
"later versions."
msgstr ""
"使用你的版本时保存的日志位置在 /bin/Debug 或 bin/Release 文件夹中，可在 Mission Planner 1.2.63 "
"及更高版本中更改此位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:226
#: a2afadcdcc6441fb81a6fe38f3a741dd
msgid ""
"If you want to make a shortcut to run your version of Mission Planner "
"without running Visual Studio, create the shortcut to point to the program "
"ArduPilotMegaPlanner10.exe in the bin/Debug or bin/Release sub folders."
msgstr ""
"如果想在不启动 Visual Studio 的情况下运行你的 Mission Planner 版本，可创建快捷方式指向 bin/Debug 或 "
"bin/Release 子文件夹中的 ArduPilotMegaPlanner10.exe 程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:231
#: fff3595aefa34451adcf5914bc359d15
msgid ""
"At this point your local version of MP should be working. You should be able"
" to connect to your ArduPilot FCU, Flight Data including status should work,"
" Configuration should bring up you ArduPilot parameters, Terminal should "
"work including saving and browsing logs. Flight Planner should also work. As"
" mentioned before, use your modified version at your own risk."
msgstr ""
"此时你的本地 MP 版本应可正常工作。你应该可以连接到 ArduPilot FCU，飞行数据（包括状态）正常显示，配置页面可加载 ArduPilot "
"参数，终端可正常工作（包括保存和浏览日志），飞行规划器也应可正常使用。如前所述，使用你修改的版本，风险自负。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:239
#: e3d240b70f434c0985dfefc04feaad74
msgid "Submitting your changes for inclusion in Master"
msgstr "提交更改以纳入主分支"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:241
#: 2aa646a27f0c4b07b9f31db15ebf9d19
msgid ""
"Generally the advice is the same as for the ArduPilot flight code "
"(:ref:`instructions here <submitting-patches-back-to-master>`) but here is a"
" very short summary of the steps:"
msgstr ""
"总体建议与 ArduPilot 飞行代码相同（:ref:`说明请参见此处 <submitting-patches-back-to-"
"master>`），以下是步骤的简短摘要："

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:245
#: 572a38f97e78405592574e93b2de240b
msgid "Sign up a member of `Git hub <https://github.com/>`__"
msgstr "注册成为 `GitHub <https://github.com/>`__ 会员"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:246
#: dc6d2e1d360a4e6695515c183a73fb92
msgid ""
"Create a personal Fork of the Mission Planner by going to "
"https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner and click on Fork  (Upper right "
"corner area)  This creates a copy (fork) of Mission Planner files in your "
"Git Hub account."
msgstr ""
"访问 https://github.com/ArduPilot/MissionPlanner，点击 Fork（右上角），创建 Mission "
"Planner 的个人 fork，这将在你的 GitHub 账户中创建 Mission Planner 文件的副本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:250
#: 0ad5b66d3ecb4cf4962c859bf13b4115
msgid "Clone your personal repo (created with the Fork above) to your PC"
msgstr "将你的个人仓库（通过上述 Fork 创建）克隆到本地电脑"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:251
#: dcf5c34be92a4bf7a6b067cd125d8f9a
msgid ""
"Create a new branch in your repo and commit your changes and push these back"
" to GitHub (these will only go into your repo on GitHub)."
msgstr "在你的仓库中创建新分支，提交更改并推送到 GitHub（这些更改只会进入你在 GitHub 上的仓库）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:253
#: 549fb4a1521f4b3683e3f1f25a86db7e
msgid "Use the GitHub web page to create a Pull Request from your branch"
msgstr "使用 GitHub 网页从你的分支创建 Pull Request（合并请求）"

#: ../../source/docs/building-mission-planner.rst:255
#: a1b251b3d6eb4bee8c54a9ab9841d41e
msgid ""
"The owner of Mission Planner (Michael Oborne) will receive an email "
"notifying him of your Pull Request.  He will most likely review, provide "
"feedback and if he accepts the commit it will be added to master."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 的所有者（Michael Oborne）将收到你的 PR "
"邮件通知。他很可能会审核、提供反馈，如果接受，你的提交将被合并到主分支。"
